# The cotxml module: values of a Cursor on Target event as the sender wrote
# them, where a consumer needs the text and not only its meaning, and one
# member of the open `detail` element that no core key covers.
module        cotxml
version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "Cursor on Target event schema (MITRE, public release); `detail/uid/@Droid` is written by the public Android Tactical Assault Kit (github.com/deptofdefense/AndroidTacticalAssaultKit-CIV) and by sensor chains that follow it"
key  time_text   string  -  "event/@time as written: the sender's clock, not parsed"
key  stale_text  string  -  "event/@stale as written"
key  uid_droid   string  -  "detail/uid/@Droid: the name the sender shows for the entity"
